<title>PAKISTAN: Latest results in Pakistani election.</title>
<headline>Latest results in Pakistani election.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistanis voted in national and provincial elections on Monday. Here are the latest results in polling for the 217-seat National Assembly (lower house):</p>
<p>    PARTY							  SEATS</p>
<p>    Pakistan Muslim League (PML)			     134</p>
<p>    Pakistan People's Party (PPP)			     19</p>
<p>    Mohajir National Movement (MQM)			   12</p>
<p>    Pakistan People's Party-Shaheed Bhutto (PPP-SB)	1</p>
<p>    Awami National Party (ANP)				   9</p>
<p>    Smaller parties/independents				28</p>
<p>Election officials said the result for one seat has been withheld because of the stealing of ballot boxes and results for 10 seats for non-Moslem minorities, which are contested on a separate list, were yet to be tabulated and would be announced in the next few days. Election in three constitutuencies was postponed because of the death of one candidate each there.</p>
</text>
